"to":9,"icon":10},{"label":12,"icon":13,"children":95},[96,97,98,99],{"label":16,"to":17,"icon":18},{"label":20,"to":21,"icon":22},{"label":24,"to":25,"icon":26},{"label":28,"to":29,"icon":30},{"label":32,"icon":33,"children":101},[102,103,104],{"label":36,"to":37,"icon":38},{"label":40,"to":41,"icon":42},{"label":44,"to":45,"icon":46},{"label":48,"icon":49,"children":106},[107,108,109],{"label":52,"to":53,"icon":54},{"label":56,"to":57,"icon":54},{"label":59,"to":60,"icon":54},{"label":62,"icon":63,"children":111},[112,113],{"label":66,"to":67,"icon":68},{"label":70,"to":71,"icon":72},{"label":74,"icon":75,"children":115},[116,117,118],{"label":78,"to":79,"icon":80},{"label":82,"to":83,"icon":84},{"label":86,"to":87,"icon":88},"Main","navigation/main","ttV2hx-8FyhWK_60qYhLTnApU2wAPB5d22U2jHRYQeo",{"id":123,"title":24,"available":124,"body":125,"coverImage":231,"currency":232,"date":233,"description":234,"extension":235,"featured":124,"image":236,"manualUrl":237,"meta":238,"navigation":124,"path":25,"playTime":231,"playerCount":231,"price":239,"published":124,"releaseDate":231,"resources":240,"seo":245,"slug":131,"stem":246,"tags":247,"thumbnail":231,"__hash__":252},"games/games/blood-neon.md",true,{"type":126,"value":127,"toc":226},"minimark",[128,132,137,141,144,167,177,184,190,192,198,204,207,210,212,220],[129,130,24],"h1",{"id":131},"blood-neon",[133,134,136],"h2",{"id":135},"a-hyperviolent-vaporwave-nightmare-ttrpg-for-3-6-fighters","A hyperviolent vaporwave nightmare ttrpg for 3-6 fighters!",[138,139,140],"p",{},"Show no mercy because you will be shown none. Bash and shred your way to glory, and become the one thing the fearless fear. The 11th Realm’s elected monarch has reached into another dimension for profit, creating a golden age of consumerism in the material world. That greed has cost the 11th Realm dearly. Now monsters from a plane only known as the Neon tear through into our reality and wreak havoc on the citizens of the land. The only thing standing between us and annihilation are heroes like you, Neon Hunters who become living weapons. Devastate the enemy, die, and die again, and ascend to new heights of power.",[142,143],"br",{},[138,145,146,147,151,152,155,156,159,160,163,164],{},"Featuring ",[148,149,150],"strong",{},"badass artwork"," by Luis Melo",[148,153,154],{},", Blood Neon"," is hyperviolent vaporwave fantasy on the tabletop. The ",[148,157,158],{},"NEON system"," let's you get right into the thick of it with ",[148,161,162],{},"fast-paced combat"," that let's the GM throw hordes of monsters at you without the brain burn. Build your own Star from a variety of classes, skills, and equipment and ",[148,165,166],{},"team up with your friends to fight back the neon horde!",[138,168,169,171,172],{},[142,170],{}," ",[173,174],"img",{"alt":175,"src":176},"BloodNeon_Infuser_V04_Delivery_Prev.jpg","https://tools.drivethrurpg.com/images/16893/_product_images/538529/BloodNeon_Infuser_V04_Delivery_Prev.jpg",[138,178,179,180,183],{},"The ",[148,181,182],{},"NEON System","  - adds strategic depth while reducing brain burn by providing the GM with pre-programmed enemy behavior.",[138,185,186,189],{},[148,187,188],{},"Momentum & Ascension"," - Demands aggressive and engaging combat. Players absorb energy from defeated enemies to replenish their health or spend it to increase the size of their damage die.",[142,191],{},[138,193,194,197],{},[148,195,196],{},"Fight, Die, and Die Again -"," When a character falls in combat, they are returned to life by the Neon Infusers and jump back into the fray! But beware, too many infusions and characters start to lose their skills, or their very identity, until their is nothing left but a unthinking killing machine.",[138,199,200,203],{},[148,201,202],{},"Connections"," - A flexible skill system gives players the flexibility to flesh out their character's backgrounds and relationships. Want to be a hunter? A blacksmith? Magician? Jester? Want to be married to the Duke? Have a sister who's a renowned thief? The choice is yours. ",[138,205,206],{},"Two to five players can run one-shots or campaigns with everything in the rulebook. Each copy of Blood Neon also comes with 3 sheets of printable stars and monsters, character sheets for each class, an adventure for new characters, and tips to make your own encounters.",[138,208,209],{},"Blood Neon was written and designed by Adam Blumenau and R. Val, art by Luis Melo",[142,211],{},[138,213,214],{},[215,216,217],"a",{"href":217,"rel":218},"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/538529/blood-neon",[219],"nofollow",[138,221,222],{},[173,223],{"alt":224,"src":225},"hiphopbard_charsheet.jpg","https://tools.drivethrurpg.com/images/16893/_product_images/538529/hiphopbard_charsheet.jpg",{"title":227,"searchDepth":228,"depth":228,"links":229},"",2,[230],{"id":135,"depth":228,"text":136},null,"USD","2022-07-31T00:00:00.000Z","A brutal vaporwave nightmare ttrpg.","md","/images/blood-neon/cover/blood-neon-cover.jpg","https://radmad.itch.io/blood-neon",{},10,[241,243],{"title":242,"url":67},"Faction Guide",{"title":244,"url":67},"GM Screen",{"title":24,"description":234},"games/blood-neon",[248,249,250,251],"tabletop","cyberpunk","adventure","cooperative","HyLL6zW22kkf-CBsKOHbej-OVhAZIUO4Xu0W13eSGO4",{"id":254,"copyright":255,"extension":5,"meta":256,"sections":298,"social":307,"stem":312,"tagline":267,"__hash__":313},"footer/footer/main.yaml","© 2025 Shrike Publishing. All rights reserved.",{"path":257,"shop":258,"body":266,"title":119},"/footer/main",{"title":48,"links":259},[260,262,264],{"platform":261,"url":53,"icon":13},"itch.io",{"platform":56,"url":57,"icon":263},"lucide:book-open",{"platform":59,"url":60,"icon":265},"lucide:coffee",{"copyright":255,"tagline":267,"sections":268,"social":278,"shop":293},"Independent storytelling studio bringing fierce adventures and characterful stories to the page and tabletop.",[269],{"title":270,"links":271},"Quick Links",[272,273,274,275,276,277],{"label":12,"to":17